From: HOTTY Agent <hotty@neuroplast.io>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 22:49:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 16/18] blitz-dom: stylesheets of the user origin

DocumentConfig::user_stylesheets and BaseDocument::add_user_stylesheet
and remove_user_stylesheet: a user stylesheet wins over the user agent's
and loses to the document's own, whatever the selectors' specificity, as
the CSS cascade orders its origins. An embedder's defaults (a theme, the
colours of form controls) can then use zero-specificity selectors such
as :where() and still override the user agent stylesheet's.
---
